WEBVTT

01:00:09.939 --> 01:00:11.816
[Despejar de líquido]

01:00:11.941 --> 01:00:12.984
[Chamuscar de fogo]

01:00:13.109 --> 01:00:13.776
[Juninho] Do jeito que os coloms

01:00:13.902 --> 01:00:14.611
costumam matar.

01:00:14.736 --> 01:00:15.695
[Gritos]

01:00:15.862 --> 01:00:17.113
[Henrique] Nao, pelo amor de De!

01:00:17.238 --> 01:00:19.490
Nao, nao, eu tô pedindo.
